{"mangaRefs":["file-641-642"],"locationRefs":[],"summary":{"en":"Kogoro, Ran, and Conan are at their usual diner but learn that their waitress' brother is a suspect in a murder. Victim: Takafumi Torihira Cause of death: Gunshot wound? Suspects: Sugihito Enomoto The waitress, Azusa Enomoto, is interrogated by the authorities about her older brother, Sugihito Enomoto. When a package containing cookies is delivered to Azusa, she leaves to go shopping while Takagi accompanies her. Takagi returns revealing Azusa escaped from him and is deduced to be meeting her brother.","zhHans":"","zhHant":"","sourcePage":"A_Present_from_the_True_Culprit","sourceQuote":true},"characters":["character-ran-mouri","character-kogoro-mouri","character-conan-edogawa","character-miwako-sato","character-azusa-enomoto","character-juzo-megure","character-kazunobu-chiba","character-detective-saitoh","character-detective-okumura","character-detective-horita","character-wataru-takagi","character-detective-nakamura"],"organizations":[],"locations":[],"gadgets":[],"caseTypes":[],"sources":["src-abiting-conan-database","src-detective-conan-world-anime"],"detailStatus":"reviewed","coverage":{"directory":true,"basicFacts":true,"structure":true,"deepSpoilers":true},"raw":{"manga":"Vol. 61~62","specialLabel":null,"rawIndex":525,"dcwMangaSource":"V61 - F11 ~ V62 - F1(641-642)","dcwMangaKind":"manga","dcwAirDate":"February 23, 2009"},"season":14,"solvedByRaw":"Conan Edogawa","solvedBy":"character-conan-edogawa","castNames":["Conan Edogawa","Kogoro Mouri","Azusa Enomoto","Ran Mouri","Wataru Takagi","Kazunobu Chiba","Juzo Megure","Miwako Sato","Sugihito Enomoto","Detective Okumura","Detective Saitoh","Detective Horita","Detective Nakamura","Unnamed officer"],"dcwL3Source":{"season":"A_Present_from_the_True_Culprit"}}